WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.263
Sit back against the pad, roller on the front of your ankles, shins vertical.

2
00:00:02.263 --> 00:00:04.527
Lift your lower legs until both legs are fully straight.

3
00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:06.790
Lower slowly all the way until your knees are bent at 90 degrees.
